<BaseLayout title="China Sourcing Tools: Region Finder and Supplier Comparison" description="Find China sourcing regions by product and compare three suppliers with a free, printable evidence worksheet. No account or email required." current="Tools" cta={false}>
<div class="growth-article"><header><h1>China sourcing tools</h1><p class="lead">Find a region to research, then compare the suppliers on your shortlist.</p></header>
<section class="two-up"><article><h2>Manufacturing hub finder</h2><p>Choose a product to see relevant regions, supplier types, source references and checks. The directory distinguishes manufacturing from wholesale markets.</p><p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/tools/china-manufacturing-hub-finder/">Find sourcing regions</a></p></article><article><h2>Supplier comparison template</h2><p>Record evidence for three suppliers. Keep unknowns and follow-up questions visible, save a comparison file or print the worksheet.</p><p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/tools/factory-visit-scorecard/">Compare suppliers</a></p></article></section>
<section class="note"><h2>Free to use, no account required</h2><p>The directory provides research starting points, not approval of individual suppliers. The comparison worksheet records your findings without assigning an automatic pass or fail.</p><p>Read the <a href="/guides/how-to-plan-a-china-factory-visit/">visit planning guide</a> or <a href="/factory-visits/">discuss support for your visits</a>.</p></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
